{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meowmentum</strong> is a first-person speedrunning platformer in which you must finish speed trials as fast as possible to become a full-fledged catmage! \ud83d\udc08\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f What are you waiting for? Go get your name on the leaderboards MEOW~!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/extras/becomeCatM_title.png?t=1753070309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your newly-found powers of Meowmentum and harness the potential of paw-kour! Run on walls, slide down ramps, and dash through magic orbs to keep going faster! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/extras/Gif_01.gif?t=1753070309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/extras/faceElders_title.png?t=1753070309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prove yourself worthy by completing the Elder Catmages' speed trials! Discover secret shortcuts and movement techniques as you paw through each trial! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/extras/Gif_02.gif?t=1753070309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/extras/masterMeow_title.png?t=1753070309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect meow-zmerizing medals and race against Catmages worldwide! Will you dominate the leaderboards and become a master of Meowmentum? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/extras/Gif_03.gif?t=1753070309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/extras/meetElders_title.png?t=1753070309\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello! We are a team of 5 core developers (+5 collab devs) aiming to create the best magical cat speedrunner in the world! We sincerely hope you enjoy our game, in whatever capacity that may be. Wanna chat with us? JOIN OUR DISCORD SERVER!! Thank you &lt;3   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>All social links are to the right of (PC) or above this description (Mobile).</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2939350?t=1753070309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/aaf9c49216948e577c8d1713eb68591d799bd3c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753070309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/162d6ce2502e71c97c6634b0fe06c0c81ca58261/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753070309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939350/162d6ce2502e71c97c6634b0fe06c0c81ca58261/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753070309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3236850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord Community</h1><p><div class=\"bb_im